OL,3,GNEWSACold War plane moved piece by
OL,4,Apiece to heritage museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic Cold War aircraft is in the
OL,7,Fprocess of being moved to a heritage
OL,8,Fmuseum in Shropshire.
OL,10,FBuilt in 1953, the Vickers Varsity
OL,11,FWL679 was the last of its kind in the
OL,12,Fworld to fly, making its final journey
OL,13,Fto RAF Cosford in July 1992.
OL,15,FAcross two days, it'll be taken apart
OL,16,Fand moved in stages to the Chetton
OL,17,FHeritage Museum, near Bridgnorth, to
OL,18,Fthen be put back together again "like a
OL,19,Fhuge airfix kit."
OL,21,FChairman of the museum, Julian
OL,22,FMillington, said it was a huge honour.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
